Ragist.com is a website run by an organization that supports online security and anonymity making it possible to meet decent people. It allows anonymous random one-to-one conversations through text and video. The website states its practices and how information is used under its "Terms of Service & Privacy Policy". Most of Ragist users use the website for the functionality of supported links, data encryption, IP address confidentiality, information access and extreme monitoring for the prevention of any nudity, threats or hate.
